# rule.always.concede-with-a-severity

> **when you concede a concern, grade it: `better` or `urgent`. `--severity` is REQUIRED — there
> is no ungraded concede (a mandatory invariant). `better` never earns budget; `urgent` is the
> closed harm set, and the only concession that earns more.**

```sh
rhx route.stone.set --stone <stone> --as conceded --with <reviewer> --about <concern> --severity better|urgent
```

⚠️ a concede with NO `--severity` is refused. `better` is the common grade, but you name it
explicitly, so the harm test is made on every concession.

the call-site half of `philosophy.a-review-budget-balances-perfection-with-pragmatism` +
`define.invariant.review.peer.budget.urgent-earns-budget`.

## .the closed urgent set

> **urgent = security · safety · monetary · reputation · behavioral. code idealism is never urgent.**

## .the test — name the harm

> **name the harm that ships if this is not fixed now.** can → `urgent` · cannot → `better`, it
> evolves. (the reviewer's `rule.forbid.overzealous-blockers` test, from the driver's seat.)

| when… | then… |
|---|---|
| you concede a point you will fix | 🔴 grade it — required. `better` for maintenance; `urgent` only if a shipped harm has a name |
| you concede with no `--severity` | refused — there is no ungraded concede (mandatory invariant) |
| you reach for `urgent` to buy a round | name the harm first. no nameable harm → `better`, and it evolves |
| a `better` concession tempts a budget ask | forbidden — `better` never earns budget. spend the floor and evolve |
| a concern is correct but cosmetic | `better`. correctness is not harm |
| the budget is hit and every concession is `better` | good enough — proceed, no human |
| an urgent concession sat on the last round | the human is warned this PR; they grant more |

blocker: a `better` concession that earns budget · an `urgent` grade with no nameable harm (the
mis-grade `rule.forbid.overzealous-blockers` forbids) · a budget hit with no urgent concession that
summons a human.

⇒ see also: `philosophy.a-review-budget-balances-perfection-with-pragmatism` ·
`define.invariant.review.peer.budget.urgent-earns-budget` · `rule.forbid.overzealous-blockers`
(reviewer) · `rule.require.grade-a-concession-by-its-harm` (reviewer).
